 per completed month of service. Unused annual leave may be carried forward to the next calendar year up to a maximum of 10 days; any balance beyond that is forfeited on December 31st unless local law requires otherwise.\r\n\r\n3. Sick Leave\n\n[Source: leave_policy.txt] (relevance: 0.49)\n3. Sick Leave\r\nEmployees are entitled to 10 days of paid sick leave per calendar year. Sick leave does not carry forward to the following year. For sick leave of 3 or more consecutive days, a medical certificate must be submitted to HR within 5 working days of returning to work.\r\n\r\n4. Casual Leave\n\n[Source: leave_policy.txt] (relevance: 0.38)\n4. Casual Leave\r\nEmployees may take up to 6 days of casual leave per calendar year for personal matters that do not qualify as sick leave, such as family emergencies or personal errands. Casual leave requests should ideally be submitted at least 1 working day in advance, though same-day requests are accepted for genuine emergencies.\r\n\r\n5. How to Apply for Leave\n\n[Source: leave_policy.txt] (relevance: 0.26)\n6. Leave During Notice Period\r\nEmployees serving their notice period (see the Notice Period Policy) may not take annual leave during the last 15 days of their notice period without explicit written approval from their manager and HR.\r\n\r\n7. Unpaid Leave\n\n[Source: leave_policy.txt] (relevance: 0.21)\n7. Unpaid Leave\r\nIn exceptional circumstances, employees who have exhausted their paid leave balance may request unpaid leave. Unpaid leave requests must be approved by both the direct manager and HR, and require at least 5 working days' notice except in emergencies.\r\n\r\n8. Public Holidays\r\nLeave taken on a day that is already a declared public holiday (see the Public Holidays Policy) is not deducted from the employee's annual leave balance.", name='search_hr_policy', id='e32622d8-bf82-43d3-8cc7-a5e38cac97ca', tool_call_id='call_dc1c52beefbf4e78bca99cccbdfc__thought__'), AIMessage(content='Every full-time employee is entitled to 18 days of paid annual leave per calendar year, accrued at a rate of 1.5 days per completed month of service. This information is from the leave_policy.txt document.', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'thought_signatures': ['']}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=104, prompt_tokens=1184, total_tokens=1288, completion_tokens_details=CompletionTokensDetailsWrapper(accepted_prediction_tokens=None, audio_tokens=None, reasoning_tokens=56, rejected_prediction_tokens=None, text_tokens=48, image_tokens=None, video_tokens=None), prompt_tokens_details=PromptTokensDetailsWrapper(audio_tokens=None, cached_tokens=None, text_tokens=1184, image_tokens=None, video_tokens=None), cache_read_input_tokens=None), 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'model_name': 'hr-llm', 'model_provider': 'litellm', 'model_id': 'ea9549931e74c4222186635978c3c226571e50284cb4a083fcf148f22659f009', 'response_cost': 0.0006152}, id='lc_run--01a17376-c5e6-7200-ba6d-bc672450237f-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1184, 'output_tokens': 104, 'total_tokens': 1288, 'output_token_details': {'reasoning': 56}})]}
