 of 1.5 days per completed month of service. Unused annual leave may be carried forward to the next calendar year up to a maximum of 10 days; any balance beyond that is forfeited on December 31st unless local law requires otherwise.\r\n\r\n3. Sick Leave\n\n[Source: exit_process_policy.txt] (relevance: 0.61)\n7. Final Settlement\r\nThe final settlement, including any pending salary, unused annual leave encashment (up to the carry-forward limit defined in the Leave Policy), and reimbursement of approved pending claims, is processed within 45 days of the last working day, in line with standard payroll cycles.\r\n\r\n8. Full and Final Documents\n\n[Source: leave_policy.txt] (relevance: 0.41)\n3. Sick Leave\r\nEmployees are entitled to 10 days of paid sick leave per calendar year. Sick leave does not carry forward to the following year. For sick leave of 3 or more consecutive days, a medical certificate must be submitted to HR within 5 working days of returning to work.\r\n\r\n4. Casual Leave\n\n[Source: leave_policy.txt] (relevance: 0.40)\n6. Leave During Notice Period\r\nEmployees serving their notice period (see the Notice Period Policy) may not take annual leave during the last 15 days of their notice period without explicit written approval from their manager and HR.\r\n\r\n7. Unpaid Leave\n\n[Source: notice_period_policy.txt] (relevance: 0.36)\n6. Leave During Notice Period\r\nAs stated in the Leave Policy, annual leave may not be taken during the final 15 days of the notice period without written approval from both the manager and HR, to ensure adequate handover time.\r\n\r\n7. Termination for Cause', name='search_hr_policy', id='3f9fd60d-2af8-4aa0-b212-cbcd53501695', tool_call_id='call_5f3b289764f84213b5ef39a98eef__thought__'), AIMessage(content='You can carry forward a maximum of 10 days of unused annual leave to the next calendar year. Any balance beyond that is forfeited on December 31st, unless local law requires otherwise.\n\n(Source: leave_policy.txt)', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'thought_signatures': ['']}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=123, prompt_tokens=1211, total_tokens=1334, completion_tokens_details=CompletionTokensDetailsWrapper(accepted_prediction_tokens=None, audio_tokens=None, reasoning_tokens=73, rejected_prediction_tokens=None, text_tokens=50, image_tokens=None, video_tokens=None), prompt_tokens_details=PromptTokensDetailsWrapper(audio_tokens=None, cached_tokens=None, text_tokens=1211, image_tokens=None, video_tokens=None), cache_read_input_tokens=None), 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'model_name': 'hr-llm', 'model_provider': 'litellm', 'model_id': 'ea9549931e74c4222186635978c3c226571e50284cb4a083fcf148f22659f009', 'response_cost': 0.0006708}, id='lc_run--01a17377-a360-7bd3-b751-1f82ea876065-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1211, 'output_tokens': 123, 'total_tokens': 1334, 'output_token_details': {'reasoning': 73}})]}
