 company each calendar year and how they interact with other leave types.\r\n\r\n2. Number of Observed Holidays\r\nThe company observes 12 public holidays per calendar year, published on the HR portal by December 1st of the preceding year. The list is based on national and regional holidays for the employee's registered work location.\r\n\r\n3. Floating Holidays\n\n[Source: holidays_policy.txt] (relevance: 0.65)\n3. Floating Holidays\r\nIn addition to the 12 fixed public holidays, employees receive 2 floating holidays per year, which can be used on any working day of the employee's choosing (for example, to observe a cultural or religious holiday not included in the standard list). Floating holidays must be requested through the HR portal at least 2 working days in advance and do not carry forward to the next year.\r\n\r\n4. Holidays Falling on a Weekend\n\n[Source: holidays_policy.txt] (relevance: 0.22)\n8. Regional Variations\r\nEmployees based in different regions or countries may observe a different holiday list appropriate to their location; HR publishes a location-specific calendar for each office.\n\n[Source: holidays_policy.txt] (relevance: 0.19)\n4. Holidays Falling on a Weekend\r\nIf a public holiday falls on a weekend, it is generally not shifted to the nearest working day unless explicitly announced by HR for that year, in which case the adjusted date will be published alongside the annual holiday calendar.\r\n\r\n5. Working on a Public Holiday\n\n[Source: holidays_policy.txt] (relevance: 0.17)\n5. Working on a Public Holiday\r\nEmployees required to work on a declared public holiday due to business needs (e.g., customer support coverage) are entitled to a compensatory day off within 30 days, in addition to any applicable holiday pay as required by local law.\r\n\r\n6. Interaction With Annual Leave", name='search_hr_policy', id='3a4f3f38-a7c9-4154-b06f-3efb80ef8717', tool_call_id='call_fba1529028f54364b8460f2122d0__thought__'), AIMessage(content='The company observes 12 public holidays per calendar year, as stated in section 2 of the Public Holidays Policy. Additionally, employees receive 2 floating holidays per year, as per section 3 of the same policy.\n\nSource: holidays_policy.txt', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'thought_signatures': ['']}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=192, prompt_tokens=1181, total_tokens=1373, completion_tokens_details=CompletionTokensDetailsWrapper(accepted_prediction_tokens=None, audio_tokens=None, reasoning_tokens=139, rejected_prediction_tokens=None, text_tokens=53, image_tokens=None, video_tokens=None), prompt_tokens_details=PromptTokensDetailsWrapper(audio_tokens=None, cached_tokens=None, text_tokens=1181, image_tokens=None, video_tokens=None), cache_read_input_tokens=None), 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'model_name': 'hr-llm', 'model_provider': 'litellm', 'model_id': 'ea9549931e74c4222186635978c3c226571e50284cb4a083fcf148f22659f009', 'response_cost': 0.0008343000000000001}, id='lc_run--01a17378-0b64-7d60-bfa8-07f14ff5cbe5-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1181, 'output_tokens': 192, 'total_tokens': 1373, 'output_token_details': {'reasoning': 139}})]}
