ncies or personal errands. Casual leave requests should ideally be submitted at least 1 working day in advance, though same-day requests are accepted for genuine emergencies.\r\n\r\n5. How to Apply for Leave', 'CODE OF CONDUCT POLICY\r\n\r\nPolicy Category: Code of Conduct\r\n\r\n1. Purpose\r\nThis policy sets out the standards of behavior expected of every employee, contractor, and manager while representing the company.\r\n\r\n2. Core Principles\r\nAll employees are expected to act with honesty, respect, and professionalism in every interaction, whether with colleagues, clients, partners, or the public, in person or online.\r\n\r\n3. Respect and Non-Discrimination', '3. Sick Leave\r\nEmployees are entitled to 10 days of paid sick leave per calendar year. Sick leave does not carry forward to the following year. For sick leave of 3 or more consecutive days, a medical certificate must be submitted to HR within 5 working days of returning to work.\r\n\r\n4. Casual Leave'], top_n: 5
