 standard notice period is 60 days (2 calendar months) for both resignation by the employee and termination initiated by the company, except in cases of termination for cause.\r\n\r\n3. Notice Period for Senior Roles\n\n[Source: probation_policy.txt] (relevance: 0.59)\n3. Notice Period During Probation\r\nDuring the probation period, either the employee or the company may terminate the employment relationship with 15 days' written notice, or payment in lieu of notice, whichever the terminating party elects. This is shorter than the standard post-confirmation notice period described in the Notice Period Policy.\r\n\r\n4. Performance Review During Probation\n\n[Source: notice_period_policy.txt] (relevance: 0.52)\nNOTICE PERIOD POLICY\r\n\r\nPolicy Category: Notice Period\r\n\r\n1. Purpose\r\nThis policy defines the notice period required when an employee resigns or when the company initiates termination of employment, outside of the probation period.\r\n\r\n2. Standard Notice Period\n\n[Source: notice_period_policy.txt] (relevance: 0.49)\n3. Notice Period for Senior Roles\r\nEmployees at the Director level and above are required to serve a notice period of 90 days, given the additional handover and succession planning typically required at that level.\r\n\r\n4. Payment in Lieu of Notice\n\n[Source: notice_period_policy.txt] (relevance: 0.48)\n5. Handover Requirements\r\nDuring the notice period, the departing employee is expected to prepare a written handover document covering ongoing projects, key contacts, and access credentials, to be reviewed with their manager no later than 10 days before the last working day.\r\n\r\n6. Leave During Notice Period", name='search_hr_policy', id='fe6868a0-26f9-417a-a8d8-3631f0353f2b', tool_call_id='call_b57b207650b3484eaabd22a3bb4c__thought__'), AIMessage(content='Once an employee has been confirmed after probation, the standard notice period is 60 days (2 calendar months) for both resignation by the employee and termination initiated by the company, except in cases of termination for cause. (Source: notice_period_policy.txt)', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'thought_signatures': ['']}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=159, prompt_tokens=1115, total_tokens=1274, completion_tokens_details=CompletionTokensDetailsWrapper(accepted_prediction_tokens=None, audio_tokens=None, reasoning_tokens=104, rejected_prediction_tokens=None, text_tokens=55, image_tokens=None, video_tokens=None), prompt_tokens_details=PromptTokensDetailsWrapper(audio_tokens=None, cached_tokens=None, text_tokens=1115, image_tokens=None, video_tokens=None), cache_read_input_tokens=None), 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'model_name': 'hr-llm', 'model_provider': 'litellm', 'model_id': 'ea9549931e74c4222186635978c3c226571e50284cb4a083fcf148f22659f009', 'response_cost': 0.000732}, id='lc_run--01a17378-5477-7e91-a889-a74f45f92dc6-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1115, 'output_tokens': 159, 'total_tokens': 1274, 'output_token_details': {'reasoning': 104}})]}
