ed physical presence (e.g., front-desk, warehouse, or facilities roles) are eligible to work from home, subject to manager approval.', name='search_hr_policy', id='b732db4a-6e4c-4f55-b841-8083953001b3', tool_call_id='call_f8f076c91f344b15a2ac760882a0__thought__'), AIMessage(content="You can work from home up to 2 days per week as a standard arrangement, provided it's agreed upon with your manager. Teams are expected to collaborate in the office for at least 3 days per week, unless your role is designated as fully remote in your employment contract. You may also request occasional additional work-from-home days by informing your manager at least one day in advance (Source: work_from_home_policy.txt).", additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'thought_signatures': ['']}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=245, prompt_tokens=1246, total_tokens=1491, completion_tokens_details=CompletionTokensDetailsWrapper(accepted_prediction_tokens=None, audio_tokens=None, reasoning_tokens=153, rejected_prediction_tokens=None, text_tokens=92, image_tokens=None, video_tokens=None), prompt_tokens_details=PromptTokensDetailsWrapper(audio_tokens=None, cached_tokens=None, text_tokens=1246, image_tokens=None, video_tokens=None), cache_read_input_tokens=None), 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'model_name': 'hr-llm', 'model_provider': 'litellm', 'model_id': 'ea9549931e74c4222186635978c3c226571e50284cb4a083fcf148f22659f009', 'response_cost': 0.0009862999999999999}, id='lc_run--01a17386-4d4a-7de2-96fb-00cdb2c77e22-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1246, 'output_tokens': 245, 'total_tokens': 1491, 'output_token_details': {'reasoning': 153}})]}
